# AI assistants
# Only personal state and generated artifacts belong here. Shared config is
# committed on purpose — AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .claude/settings.json,
# .claude/agents/, .cursor/rules/, .github/copilot-instructions.md — because
# that is what keeps every contributor and agent on the same rules.
